{{# The whole site map: a stable map f : (C, x1, x2, x3) -> X. It is rendered
    twice, because an SVG viewBox cannot change with a media query: once laid
    out left to right, and once top to bottom for narrow screens. CSS shows one
    of the two. #}}
<figure class="figure">
  <svg class="fig fig--wide" viewBox="40 40 940 345" role="group" aria-label="{{ ui[lang].figure_label }}">
    <g>{{ include "figure/curve.vto" }}</g>
    {{ include "figure/map.vto" { vertical: false } }}
    <g>{{ include "figure/target.vto" }}</g>
  </svg>
  <svg class="fig fig--tall" viewBox="0 0 420 835" role="group" aria-label="{{ ui[lang].figure_label }}">
    <g transform="translate(-30 -45)">{{ include "figure/curve.vto" }}</g>
    {{ include "figure/map.vto" { vertical: true } }}
    <g transform="translate(-585 450)">{{ include "figure/target.vto" }}</g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    {{ if lang === "zh" }}
    <b>图 1.</b> 一个亏格 2 的稳定映射 <i>f</i> : (<i>C</i>, <i>x</i><sub>1</sub>, <i>x</i><sub>2</sub>, <i>x</i><sub>3</sub>) → <i>X</i>，插入为 <i>α</i><sub>1</sub>, <i>α</i><sub>2</sub>, <i>α</i><sub>3</sub> ∈ <i>A</i><sup>∗</sup>(<i>X</i>)。点击任意标签即可打开对应页面。
    {{ else }}
    <b>Figure 1.</b> A stable map <i>f</i> : (<i>C</i>, <i>x</i><sub>1</sub>, <i>x</i><sub>2</sub>, <i>x</i><sub>3</sub>) → <i>X</i> of genus 2, with insertions <i>α</i><sub>1</sub>, <i>α</i><sub>2</sub>, <i>α</i><sub>3</sub> ∈ <i>A</i><sup>∗</sup>(<i>X</i>). Every label opens a page.
    {{ /if }}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
